  "goodToKnow": "Das Hilfsmittel is an aid or tool: technische Hilfsmittel. On German exam papers, Hilfsmittel: keine means no dictionaries, calculators or notes allowed. In health care, Hilfsmittel are items like wheelchairs, hearing aids and walking frames (Rollator), which health insurance often pays for with a prescription. From die Hilfe (help) and das Mittel (means), with a linking s. The plural is the same."
